WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:04.789
In JavaScript, comments are exactly the same. Only console.log changes.

2
00:04.789 --> 00:09.589
Comments are also a quick way to switch code off: the disabled line does not appear in the console.

3
00:09.589 --> 00:14.667
In your editor, Ctrl+/ turns comments on or off for the selected lines.
